msgstr "HKG 低速轉向扭力（實驗功能）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/steering.py
msgid "Uses the 2022 HKG low-speed profile: torque stays at 384 with 10/10 steering rates through 39.6 km/h, then blends to 350 and the normal 2/3 rates by 46.8 km/h. Torque tapers to 270 by 61.2 km/h and remains 270 at higher speeds. It also enables one automatic lane change from a single blinker request at 0-5 km/h. Default: off. Change only offroad; applies next drive. Requires vehicle validation."
msgstr "採用 2022 HKG 低速設定：39.6 km/h 以下扭力維持 384，轉向速率為 10/10；接著於 46.8 km/h 前平滑銜接至 350 與一般 2/3。扭力於 61.2 km/h 降至 270，高速維持 270。此開關也會啟用 0–5 km/h 下，以單次方向燈請求觸發的一次自動變換車道。預設關閉；僅限非行車狀態調整，於下次行車生效。仍須實車驗證。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/steering.py
msgid "Start the vehicle to check vehicle compatibility."
msgstr "啟動車輛以檢查相容性。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/steering.py
msgid "Unavailable for this vehicle. Requires compatible HKG CAN-FD torque steering."
msgstr "此車型無法使用。需要相容的 HKG CAN-FD 扭力轉向系統。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/visuals.py
