msgstr "Kia EV6 原廠儀表左右車輛顯示"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/visuals.py
msgid "Keep real left/right vehicle graphics on the Kia factory instrument cluster while sunnypilot longitudinal control or Experimental Mode is active. Display only: this does not enable Kia automatic lane changes or use side targets for driving decisions. Unsupported firmware, stale data, or a CAN sender conflict produces no added vehicle graphic. A restart is required after changing this setting."
msgstr "當 sunnypilot 縱向控制或實驗模式啟用時，在 Kia 原廠儀表保留真實左右車輛圖形。此功能僅供顯示：不會啟用 Kia 原廠自動變道，也不會將側方目標用於駕駛決策。不支援的韌體、過期資料或 CAN 發送者衝突都不會補入車輛圖形。變更此設定後需要重新啟動。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/visuals.py
